  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, garlic, and sumac.",
    "3. Add the chicken to the marinade and mix well.",
    "4. Thread the marinated chicken onto the kebab skewers.",
    "5. Brush the grill with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
    "6. Grill the kebabs for 8-10 minutes, or until cooked through.",
    "7. Rotate the kebabs halfway through cooking.",
    "8. Serve hot, garnished with sliced olives and a sprinkle of sumac."
